OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews back at burnt hotel
OL,4,Aafter smoke report
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have returned to a seaside
OL,7,Fhotel after reports of smoke from an
OL,8,Farea affected by a previous fire.
OL,10,FKent Fire and Rescue Service sent three
OL,11,Ffire engines, later reduced to two, to
OL,12,Fthe Grand Burstin Hotel in Folkestone
OL,13,Fat about 08:30 BST and said it was
OL,14,F"assessing the area".
OL,16,F"It's believed the smoke has been
OL,17,Fcaused by smouldering laundry," the
OL,18,Ffire service said.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
